            <title>[LU-21154] LFU: lfu-resync, a daemon that resyncs and adds FLR mirrors by policy</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21154</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;FLR mirrors made stale by writes stay stale until someone runs &lt;tt&gt;lfs mirror resync&lt;/tt&gt;, and nothing adds mirrors by policy, for example a capacity mirror for files written to a Fast Tier pool.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Add &lt;tt&gt;lfu-resync&lt;/tt&gt;, as described in the lfu-resync HLD by Andreas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;A scanner, one per MDT, finds files to resync or extend. It reads the MDT changelog as a registered user and scans the MDT device at a limited rate for what the changelog missed. Each file waits until it has been idle for its class's resync delay.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Policy classes use &lt;tt&gt;lfs find&lt;/tt&gt; predicates, and say whether to resync and which pool to add a mirror in. Free space limits stop adding mirrors to a pool that is filling up.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The copies are done by agents on clients. The scanner queues a new HSM coordinator action, &lt;tt&gt;HSMA_RESYNC&lt;/tt&gt;, which agents register for by archive id, like a copytool. It does not use or change the HSM state of the file.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;lfu-resync --fid&lt;/tt&gt; resyncs one file by hand.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;systemd units for the scanner and the agent, YAML statistics on SIGUSR1, reload on SIGHUP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;The agent needs two pieces that are static in &lt;tt&gt;lfs.c&lt;/tt&gt; now, so they move to the library:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;llapi_mirror_resync_file()&lt;/tt&gt;, the lease and resync sequence of &lt;tt&gt;lfs mirror resync&lt;/tt&gt;. This also fixes &lt;tt&gt;lfs mirror resync&lt;/tt&gt; reporting success when the lease is lost.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;llapi_mirror_extend()&lt;/tt&gt;, which adds a stale mirror without copying data (on top of &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-17531" title="'lfs mirror extend' should succeed with stale mirror on open-for-write files" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-17531"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-17531&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;tt&gt;--no-resync&lt;/tt&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Phase 1 of the HLD: the scanner needs a client mount on the MDS. EC and compressed mirrors, and client mode, come later.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
